  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Preview release for Windows and .NET Framework 4.8.1. Fixes attachment to already-open models using the output-VARIANT GetSTAADFile signature, class-ID ROT discovery and polling for the requested model with available Geometry and Load interfaces. Documents installation in legacy WPF projects. Includes 21 OpenSTAAD load assignment and load-case metadata queries, inclusive ID ranges, requested-ID filtering and concrete family lists, with expanded IntelliSense and package guides. Engineering units and broader supported-version compatibility remain pending validation before a stable release. Full release notes: https://github.com/structuraldeveloper/StaadPro.Interop/blob/main/docs/Release-Notes.md",
